<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.00 lower compared to Thursday. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-290 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Mostly steady. Top 51.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-700 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
</text>
